          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My root",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.29.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.29.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spread out by the waters, and the dew lay all night upon my branch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My glory",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.29.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.29.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fresh in me, and my bow was renewed in my hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unto me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.29.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.29.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gave ear, and waited, and kept silence at my counsel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After my words they spake not again; and my speech dropped upon them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they waited for me as for the rain; and they opened their mouth wide",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.29.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.29.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the latter rain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.29.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.29.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I laughed on them, they believed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.29.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.29.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not; and the light of my countenance they cast not down.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I chose out their way, and sat chief, and dwelt as a king in the army, as one",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.29.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.29.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "comforteth the mourners.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
